Purpose: Add an opt-in --android mode to the upstream build script that builds exactly one additional target, opencode-android-arm64, for Android (Bionic). The mode maps the target to the valid Bun compile target bun-linux-arm64-android and stages the Android native assets named by OPENICK_ANDROID_ASSETS (Plan 0002, Section 7) into the dependency tree before bundling. Without --android the script behaves exactly as upstream.
Upstream files: packages/opencode/script/build.ts
Rebase note: Check the flag declarations, the targets ternary, the dependency installation block, the compile target expression, and the release tarball condition first; those are the five anchor points of this patch.

